**CRITICAL**: Use custom form components from `@forms/` for all form controls.

## Base UI Form Components - Usage Patterns and Validation

### Component Selection Priority
**ALWAYS** use components in this order:
1. **Custom Form Components** (`@forms/`) - PREFERRED for all form controls
2. **Base UI Components** - Only when custom components don't fit
3. **Custom implementations** - Only when neither custom nor Base UI components fit

### Available Custom Form Components

#### ValidatedInput (PREFERRED)
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Use ValidatedInput for text inputs
import { ValidatedInput } from '@forms/';

const CharacterNameField = () => (
    <ValidatedInput
        field="name"
        label="Character Name"
        inputExtraClassName="w-full px-3 py-2 border rounded-md"
    />
);
```

#### ValidatedCustomSelect (PREFERRED)
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Use ValidatedCustomSelect for dropdowns
import { ValidatedCustomSelect } from '@forms/';

const ClassSelect = () => (
    <ValidatedCustomSelect
        field="class"
        label="Choose character class"
        options={[
            { value: 'fighter', label: 'Fighter' },
            { value: 'wizard', label: 'Wizard' },
            { value: 'rogue', label: 'Rogue' }
        ]}
    />
);
```

#### CustomSelect (Basic)
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Use CustomSelect for basic dropdowns
import { CustomSelect } from '@forms/';

const BasicSelect = () => (
    <CustomSelect
        label="Select option"
        options={options}
        value={value}
        onChange={setValue}
    />
);
```

#### CustomSelectMulti (Multi-select)
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Use CustomSelectMulti for multi-select with logic
import { CustomSelectMulti } from '@forms/';

const MultiSelect = () => (
    <CustomSelectMulti
        label="Select multiple options"
        options={options}
        value={selectedValues}
        onChange={setSelectedValues}
        logic="OR" // or "AND"
    />
);
```

#### CustomCheckbox (PREFERRED)
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Use CustomCheckbox for checkboxes
import { CustomCheckbox } from '@forms/';

const FeatureCheckbox = () => (
    <CustomCheckbox
        field="hasFeature"
        label="Has special feature"
        checked={hasFeature}
        onChange={setHasFeature}
    />
);
```

#### SliderControl (PREFERRED)
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Use SliderControl for sliders
import { SliderControl } from '@forms/';

const StatSlider = () => (
    <SliderControl
        label="Strength"
        value={strength}
        onChange={setStrength}
        min={1}
        max={20}
        step={1}
    />
);
```

#### ValidatedForm (PREFERRED)
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Use ValidatedForm for form containers
import { ValidatedForm, useValidatedForm } from '@forms/';

const CharacterForm = () => {
    const { formData, setFormData, validation } = useValidatedForm(
        characterSchema, 
        initialData, 
        setFormData
    );

    return (
        <ValidatedForm 
            onSubmit={handleSubmit}
            formData={formData}
            setFormData={setFormData}
            validation={validation}
        >
            <ValidatedInput field="name" label="Character Name" />
            <ValidatedCustomSelect field="class" label="Class" options={classOptions} />
            <button type="submit">Save Character</button>
        </ValidatedForm>
    );
};
```

### Form Validation Integration

#### Schema Definition
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Define validation schemas
import { z } from 'zod';

const characterSchema = z.object({
    name: z.string().min(1, "Name is required"),
    class: z.string().min(1, "Class is required"),
    level: z.number().min(1).max(20),
    strength: z.number().min(1).max(20)
});
```

#### Validation Usage
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Use validation with form components
const CharacterForm = () => {
    const { formData, setFormData, validation } = useValidatedForm(
        characterSchema, 
        initialData, 
        setFormData
    );

    return (
        <ValidatedForm 
            onSubmit={handleSubmit}
            formData={formData}
            setFormData={setFormData}
            validation={validation}
        >
            <ValidatedInput 
                field="name" 
                label="Character Name"
                error={validation.errors.name}
            />
        </ValidatedForm>
    );
};
```

### Composition Patterns

#### Custom Components with Base UI
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Compose with custom form components
import { ValidatedInput, ValidatedForm, useValidatedForm } from '@forms/';

const CharacterNameField = ({ field, label, error }) => (
    <ValidatedInput
        field={field}
        label={label}
        inputExtraClassName="w-full px-3 py-2 border rounded-md"
    />
);

const CharacterForm = () => {
    const { formData, setFormData, validation } = useValidatedForm(
        characterSchema, 
        initialData, 
        setFormData
    );

    return (
        <ValidatedForm 
            onSubmit={handleSubmit}
            formData={formData}
            setFormData={setFormData}
            validation={validation}
        >
            <CharacterNameField 
                field="name"
                label="Character Name"
            />
            {/* Other fields */}
        </ValidatedForm>
    );
};
```

